<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">- Melo New Testament Latin</book>
  <para style="h">Efisoon</para>
  <para style="toc1">Phawuloosa Efisoone Asayis xaafeez Kiitaa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Efisoon</para>
  <para style="toc3">Efi.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Phawuloosa Efisoone Asayis Xaafeez Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt">Gelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Phawuloosa Efisoone yez asayis xaafeez kiitay ubbaypp aathii be7eezay, «Wode heliko Xoossii polodayis qoppeez qofay, salonnee sa7a yez medhetith ubbay Kiristtoosapp oommo maaqqoday garkkesii» yeegiz qofa (1:10). Yeyil afa gujjii Yesuus Kiristtoosar yez pettipettithayid, as zereth ubbay petto maaqqoday garkk yha gita qofa oosol peeshshoday garkk Xooss woyita qoppisiza.</para>
  <para style="ip">Efisoone kiitay tiina kifilayid xaafeez kaara qofa maaqqeez pettipettith bagga xaafodayis aykkeezana dalggisii, Xoossay Aday fa asa wayizii dooreezako, unttikka E na7a, Yesuus Kiristtoosar fa nagarapp maarotith denggeeza wayizii wallo kezeezakonnee, Xoossa gita ufayss qaalay Geeshsha Ayyana baggar tuma maaqqeezay wayizii erintteezako odiza. Nam7intho kifilayid ma xaafeezay yha kiita nabbabiza asay fa pettipettith yessayid Kiristtoosar unttis yez pettipettithay tuma maaqqoday garkk u wayizii yezodayis beezizako qofisiza.</para>
  <para style="ip">Asay Kiristtoosar yez pettipetteth wayizii yezodayis beezizako duma duma aazisor qoncceeza. Woosa keetha asetithis aaziso maaqqin Kiristtoosa ye asetithayis kustte. Woosa keethi gimbbe keethar aazisinttin Kiristtoosa ye keetha muumer tookkii aykkiz kirkiro garkk maaqqiz waanna shuchch. Woosa keetha machchir aazisinttiza wode Kiristtoosa azinar aazisintteeza. Xaafay Kiristtoosa baggar qoncceez Xoossa aadho kehetithapp gaame soobii odittar, ganccay ciimmottiza nashsha nashshiza. E ubba baz, Kiristtoosa siiqo, e yarshshintto, E inggeez nagara atotitha, E aadho keehetithinnee e geeshshitith baggar benttiza.</para>
  <para style="iot">Efisoone kiitay aykkeez qofita</para>
  <para style="io1">Sarotho <char style="ior"><ref loc="EPH 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristtoosannee woosa keeth <char style="ior"><ref loc="EPH 1:3-3:21">1:3—3:21</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristtoosar yez oroth de7o <char style="ior"><ref loc="EPH 4:1-6:20">4:1—6:20</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kustte qofa <char style="ior"><ref loc="EPH 6:21-24">6:21-24</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Sarotho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1"/>Xooss shener Kiristtoosa Yesuusa hawaare maaqqeez Phawuloosapp, Efisoone yez geeshshitayisinnee Kiristtoosa Yesuusa ammanizitayis xaafintteez kiita.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:19-21">Haw. O. 18:19-21</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:1">19:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2"/>Xooss nu Adayppennee Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosapp aadho keehatithinnee sarotithii yinttis maaqqo.<verse eid="EPH 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayyana anjjo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3"/>Salo yez ayyana anjjo ubbayir Kiristtoosa baggar nuna anjjeez, nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa Aday, Xoossay galatintto. <verse eid="EPH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4"/>Nuunii e tiina geshetithar boro baazita maaqqoday garkk Xoossii alame medhinttodaypp tiina Kiristtoosa baggar fa siiqor nuna dooreeza. <verse eid="EPH 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5"/>Xoossii fa shenayid fa doseezay garkk Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggar nuna fa na7ita udodayis tiinatii qoppii gaddeeza. <verse eid="EPH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6"/>Xoossii fa siiqiza Na7ay baggar nuus cere inggeez bonchchintteez aadho keehatithay galatinttoday garkk yeya udeeza.<verse eid="EPH 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7"/>Xoossa aadho keehatith duretithay garkk Kiristtoosa suuthar wozinttii nagaras atotith nu denggeeza. <verse eid="EPH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8"/>Fa aadho keehatitha ecetitharannee eratithar gaanthii nuus inggeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:14">Qol. 1:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9"/>Xoossay fa qoppii gaddeezay garkk Kiristtoosa baggar e shene xuura nu eroday garkk ootheeza. <verse eid="EPH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10"/>Wode hellodar Xoossii polodayis qoppeez qofay, salonnee sa7a yez medhetith ubba Kiristtoosapp oommo udodayisii.<verse eid="EPH 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11"/>Ubba baz fa shene garkk oothiza Xoossay, tiinatii fa qoppii gaddeezay garkk Kiristtoosa baggar nuunii E irisitta laattoday garkk nuna dooreeza. <verse eid="EPH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12"/>Yeyi haneezay, Kiristtoosal ufayss gaddii naagor tiina maaqqeez nuunii Xooss boncha galatar qonccisoday garkkesii. <verse eid="EPH 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13"/>Yinttikka yi atotith Wonggile, yeykka tuma qaala si7eez wode Kiristtoosana ammaneeza. Xoossay yinttis inggod geez Geeshsha Ayyana maatame yinttal gaddeeza. <verse eid="EPH 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14"/>Yeykka Xooss bonchchay galatinttoday garkk Xoossay fa asa wozod gatho Geeshsha Ayyana nu laattod gadayis nuus saath udii inggeeza.<verse eid="EPH 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa woosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15"/>Yeyi gishos, Goda Yesuusall yinttis yez ammanannee geeshshitayis yez yi siiqa ta si7ii <verse eid="EPH 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16"/>ta woosayir yinttan qoppittar yi gishos Xoossa galatizana ashshekkaya. <verse eid="EPH 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17"/>Nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa Xoossa, boncho Ada yi aathii eroday garkk ecetithinnee qonccith ayyana yinttis immaday garkk ta woosiza. <verse eid="EPH 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18"/>Xoossay yinttan xeegeez ufayssaynnee geeshshitay laattiza bonchcho laatay ab garkk gaameezako yi erodayiss Xoossay yi wozina aafa dooyod garkk taanii Xoossa woosiza.<verse eid="EPH 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19"/>Ma eza ammaniza nuur oothiza e wolqqay ab garkk aadho dammazako yi eroday garkk ta woosiza. <verse eid="EPH 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20"/>Kiristtoosana yhayiqopp denthii, salo fa ushachch baggar bettitheez kiristtoosar ootheez gita wolqqa. <verse eid="EPH 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21"/>E sunthay, aqisizitayppenne mawuter yezitaypp, mooddizitayppennee goditaypp, aath maaqqii yha alamayil aadda baazin tiinapp ye7od alamayidakka hara sunth ubbitaypp aadho boncho sunth inggeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Maz. 110:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22"/>Xoossay ubba baz Kiristtoosa toke oommo haariseeza; ma woosa keethis ubba bazar kustte maaqqod garkk eza shuumeeza. <verse eid="EPH 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23"/>Woosa keethay Kiristtoosas asetithii. Izakka Kiristtoosa ubbabazar kunthiz Ees iza E kunthato.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:6">Maz. 8:6</ref>; <ref loc="COL 1:22-23">Qol. 1:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="COL 1:18">1:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 1:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Kiristtoosar yhayiqopp de7oko piinggith</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1"/>Yhaypp tiina yi, yi nagarayirannee yi qohayir yhayqqeezita.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1-5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:13">Qol. 2:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2"/>Ye wode yi yha alamay iita oga kaalleeza. Carkkol afa yez wolqqitay halaqaysinnee yhattekka Xoossayis azazinttowa na7itayir oothiz ayyaanas yi azazintteeza. <verse eid="EPH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3"/>Nu ubbaykka tiina ye asitay gancce nu asho amonnee nu wozina shene kaallii yezeeza. Nuunikka yhankkitay garkk nu medhetithar pirdda ekkodayis yezeezita.<verse eid="EPH 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4"/>Zin Xooss gita maarotithayppennee nuus yez E gita siiqaypp denddeezayid, <verse eid="EPH 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5"/>Hara attozin nuunii nu qohopp dendeezayid yhayqqii yezin Kiristtoosa baggar nuus de7o inggeeza. Xooss aadho keehatithayir yinttikka atteeza. <verse eid="EPH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6"/>Xoossii nuna Kiristtoos yesuusar pettipp yhayiqopp denthii salo ezar wolla gaddeeza. <verse eid="EPH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7"/>E yeya ootheezay, Kiristtoosa Yesuusa baggar nuus qoncciseez fa keehetithinnee zawa baa fa aadho keehetith duretitha ye7od laythitayid nuna beessadayis yeya ootheeza. <verse eid="EPH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8"/>Yi paxeezay ammano baggar E aadho keehatithayira. Yeykka, Xooss imotapp attin yi oosor benttekkaya. <verse eid="EPH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9"/>Oonkka ceeqinttaamay garkk paxotith aadho keehatithay bentteezay as oosor baaya. <verse eid="EPH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10"/>Xoossii nuus tiinatii giigisii gaddeez lo77o oosita oothoday garkkennee ezayir yessadayis Kiristtoos Yesuusa baggar maaqqii medhintteez Xooss medhetithita;<verse eid="EPH 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristtoosar yez pettipettith</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11"/>Yeyi gishos, yinttano sisa yi yelintto Ayihude baazitayyo, Ayihuditay fana as kusher dookalintteezita gi gayirttar, yinttan ma dookalinttekazita gi borizana akaakoytta. <verse eid="EPH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12"/>Ye wode yi Kiristtoosapp shaakinttii yezeezana, Isreele asayis allaga maaqqii yezeezana, Xooss qaala caaqayis haakkii yezeezannee yha alamel ufayssinnee Xooss bayth yezeezana akaakoytta. <verse eid="EPH 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13"/>Zini yi tiina haakkii yezeezitay, yhatt Kiristtoosa Yesuusar yezi E suuthay baggar Xoossiko uukkeeza.<verse eid="EPH 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14"/>Nam77ii shaakkii gaddeez morkketith gabbara fa ashayir laalii Ayihudenne Ayihude baa asa timii petto udeezay Kiristtoosa sarotitha. <verse eid="EPH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15"/>E paar yha nam77ii zaritaypp pettii oroth as medhdhodayis, higge azazannee wogita pettipp fa ashayir dhabisii sarotithi inggeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:14">Qol. 2:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16"/>Kiristtoosa mazqalel afa yhayqqii morkkintto dhabiseeza; ma nam77ii kochita pettii asho udii Xoossar igintheeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:20">Qol. 1:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17"/>Kiristtoosa yi7ii, Xoossapp haakkii yez yinttis, ma ukkii yez unttis sarotith Wonggile odeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 57:19">Isa. 57:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18"/>Nu ubbay e baggar pettii Ayyanar Aday tiina shiiqodayiss danda7eeza.<verse eid="EPH 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19"/>Yhaypp yi allaga woy imathita baaya, zin yi yhatti geeshshitayir gade asinnee Xoossis kara asita. <verse eid="EPH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20"/>Yinttii hawaaritayinnee nabitay baaseez baasayil afa keexxintteeza. Keetha muumer tookkii aykkeez kirkiro garkk shuchchay Kiristtoosa Yesuusa. <verse eid="EPH 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21"/>Ezal keeth ubbay pettipp aykkinttii Godayil geeshsha Xooss kara maaqqodayis dicciza. <verse eid="EPH 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22"/>Yi ma Xoossii fa Ayyanar yeziza keeth maaqqodayis Kiristtoosar pettipp keexxinttiza.<verse eid="EPH 2:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Ayihude baa asayis hawaare maaqqeez Phawuloosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1"/>Yeyi gishos, taanii, Phawuloosa, Ayihude baa maaqqeez yi gishos Kiristtoosa Yesuusar achch as maaqqeeza. <verse eid="EPH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2"/>Ta yinttan maaddoday garkk Xoossii fa aadho keehatithayir taas inggeez yha oosay bagga yi lo7ithii si7eeza. <verse eid="EPH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3"/>Ta yinttis tiina haatar xaafeezay garkk Xoossii fa xuura qonccithar taas beezeeza. <verse eid="EPH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4"/>Ta xaafeezana yi nabbabiza wode Kiristtoosa xuura ta ab garkk ereezako yi akaakodayis danda7iza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4-6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:26-27">Qol. 1:26-27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5"/>Yha xuuray geeshsha hawaaritayisinnee nabitayis yhatti Ayyana baggar qoncciseezay garkk binii wode asayis yhay garkk qonccisekkaya. <verse eid="EPH 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6"/>Yha Xuuray beezizay: Ayihude maaqqekka asay Wonggile baggar Isra7eelitayira pettipp Xooss iristte laattiza. Isra7eeltayir pettii asetith maaqqiza; Kiristtoosa Yesuusa baggar Xooss ufayss qaala ekkiza.<verse eid="EPH 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7"/>Xoossii fa oothiza wolqqay baggar taas inggeez aadho keehetithayid ta yha Wonggilayis oososanchcho maaqqeeza. <verse eid="EPH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8"/>Taanii geeshshitay ubbaypp laafa maaqqikokka Ayihude maaqqekka asayis zawa baa Kiristtoosa duretith Wonggile ododay garkk yha aadho keehatithay taas inggitteeza. <verse eid="EPH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9"/>Ma binii wode ubba medhdheez Xoossar qosinttii yez xuurayis, Xooss qofay abizako ubbayis qonccisodayis aadho keehatithay taas inggintteeza. <verse eid="EPH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10"/>Xoossii yeya ootheezay yhatte wode woosa keethay baggar salo yez halaqitayisinnee mawuter yezitayis fa duma duma ecetitha erisodayisii. <verse eid="EPH 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11"/>Xoossii fa medhina qofa nu Goda Kiristtoosa Yesuusa baggar polodayis yeya udeeza. <verse eid="EPH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12"/>Nu ammanor yashsha bayith Xoossiko shiiqoday garkk Kiristtoosa nuus minotethinnee mawute inggeeza.<verse eid="EPH 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13"/>Taanii yi bagga ekkiza mettay yinttis bonchcho. Yey gishos yi taan metinttizana bi7ii ufayis gachchaamay garkk yinttan woosiza.<verse eid="EPH 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Efesoona asayis woosintteez woosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14"/>Taanii Xooss Aday tiina bunqqinttii woossizay yey gishos. <verse eid="EPH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15"/>Salonnee sa7a yez medhetith ubbayis sunthii Xoossapp ingginttiza. <verse eid="EPH 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16"/>Xoossii fa bonchcho duretithaypp yi gancce asetitha minithiza wolqqa fa Ayyana baggar inggod garkk yinttis woosiza. <verse eid="EPH 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17"/>Maakka ammanor Kiristtoosa yi wozinayid yessaday garkkennee yi siiqor xapho dakkii miinggii yezoday garkk ta woosiza. <verse eid="EPH 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18"/>Yey garkkekka, Kiristtoosa siiqqay waafa garkk dalggeezako, adussizako, dhoqqazakonnee ciimmozako geeshshitay ubbayira eriza wolqqa yi akaakoday garkk ta woosiza. <verse eid="EPH 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19"/>Eratetithapp aadhiz Kiristtoosa siiqo yi eroday garkk inggiza Xoossapp maaqqeez kunthatiyir yi kumod garkk ta woosiza.<verse eid="EPH 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20"/>Yikkee, nu gancce oothiza fa wolqqay baggar nuunii woossizaypp woy qoppizaypp aathii oothodayis danda7iza Xoossayis, <verse eid="EPH 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21"/>woosa keethannee Kiristtoosa Yesuusa baggar Xoossis medhetith ubbaypp wode ubbayid medhinapp medhina hellodayis bonchcho maaqqo. Amin77ee.<verse eid="EPH 3:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Kiristtoosar yez pettipetteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1"/>Yikkee, Goday gishos accintteez taanii, yi xeegintteez xeeginttithayid beeziza yess yezoday garkk yinttan woosiza. <verse eid="EPH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2"/>Yi ubba wode aadannee haayo maaqqoytta; pettay petta danda7oyttannee siiqor yezoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:12-13">Qol. 3:12-13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3"/>Sarotithar acinttii Ayyana pettipettetha naagodayis miinggoytta. <verse eid="EPH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4"/>Xoossii yinttan xeegeez wode pettii ufayssas xeegeezay garkk pettii asetithinnee pettii Ayyana yeza. <verse eid="EPH 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5"/>Pettii Goda, pettii ammanonnee pettii xinqqate yeza. <verse eid="EPH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6"/>Ubbapp aathay, ubbayir oothizannee ubbay gancce yez pettii Xooss, ubbayis Ade yeza.<verse eid="EPH 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7"/>Zini Kiristtoosa inggodayis koyeez imotay garkk nuus pettayis pettayis aadho keehatithii inggintteeza. <verse eid="EPH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8"/>Yeyi gishos, Xooss qaalay,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">«E udee kezeez wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">di77ii gaamita paar ekkii qiteeza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">asayiskka imotita inggeeza»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EPH 4:8">yeegiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 68:18">Maz. 68:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9"/>Yeezin, «Udee kezeeza» guussay E tiina sulle, sa7a ziqqa aqo wodhdheeza guuss maaqqaam ixxiko ab guuso? <verse eid="EPH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10"/>Yha sulle wodhdheezay, ubba kunthodayis ubbapp dhoqqa salo kezeezay eza.<verse eid="EPH 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11"/>E pettita pettita hawaare, pettita pettita nabe, pettita pettita Wonggile sabaakita, pettita pettita woosa kara aqisizitannee asitamaarita maaqqaday garkk imota inggeeza. <verse eid="EPH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12"/>E yeya udeezay Kiristtoosas asetith maaqqeez woosa keetha dichchodayisinnee ammaniza asa Xooss oosos giigisodayisii. <verse eid="EPH 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13"/>Yey garkkekka, nu ubbay Xooss Na7a erii ammanor benttiz pettipettethikko hellii, Kiristtoosa ayyana de7o kunthetithyiko hellii folo as maaqqii diccoday garkkesii.<verse eid="EPH 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14"/>Yikkepp guye, asay doosha gener maaqqeez balithiza worddo timirtte carkkorannee abba gotera gedennee yhana kulo kaa7iza duuditay garkk maaqqodayis beezooya. <verse eid="EPH 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15"/>Zini nuunii tumana siiqor odittar ubba bazar asetithis kustte maaqqeez Kiristtoosako dichchoda. <verse eid="EPH 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16"/>Kunth asetithay Kiristtoosar aykkinttiza ma duma duma asetith billititay pettay pettayir aykkinttii betteeza. Pettii pettii asetith kifilay fa ooso oothodar kunth asetithay siiqor miinggoday garkk asetitha diccoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:19">Qol. 2:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristtoosar oroth yess</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17"/>Yhaypp gede kaha dhabin cere qofar ammanoowa as garkk yezipatte, taanii yhaya yinttis Goday sunthayir odizannee markkattiza. <verse eid="EPH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18"/>U qofay dhumeeza; u fa wozina muumiseeza. Unttii eretith dhaborannee ixxora Xoossii inggiza de7aypp haakkeeza. <verse eid="EPH 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19"/>Unttii yeella gizibaz eroowa; unttii tuna ooso ubba polodayis zhimbarosinnee asho amos fana aathii inggeeza.<verse eid="EPH 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20"/>Zini yi Kiristtoosa bagga tamaareezay yey garkk oger baaya. <verse eid="EPH 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21"/>E baz tuma si7eeza. Ma Yesuusar yez tuma yi eepp tamaareeza. <verse eid="EPH 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22"/>Yi tiina yezeez oga ashshoytta. Ma dooshshii amor dhabisiza yi cima atha qaarii oloytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:9">Qol. 3:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23"/>Yi wozina qofayir ooroxoytta. <verse eid="EPH 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24"/>Tuma xillotitharannee geeshshetithar Xooss aazisor medhintteez oroth asetitha ma77oytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26">Medhe. 1:26</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:10">Qol. 3:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25"/>Yikk, worddo odinttipate. Nuunii ubbay Kiristtoosa asetith billitita maaqqeez gishos as ubbayira turo odinttoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 8:16">Zak. 8:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26"/>Gayilinttoytta zin yi gayilayir nagara oothipate. Yi gayilinttii yezin awa yinttal gelippe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 4:4">Maz. 4:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27"/>Dabulosas oge doyipatte. <verse eid="EPH 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28"/>Kasitiza athay yikkepp guye kasttippe. Zini manqqita maaddiza baz ees yezoday garkk fa kusher lo77o baz ootho.<verse eid="EPH 4:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29"/>Yi doonaypp iita qaala kezippe. Zini si7izitayis maaddoday garkkennee yhankkita minthathos koshshiza lo77o qaala yi doonaypp kezo. <verse eid="EPH 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30"/>Xoossii yinttan wozeezana erisodayis ye gallasis yinttal attaamii gaddeez Xoossa Ayyana azzanthipate. <verse eid="EPH 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31"/>Canggintto, yilo, kachchii, uufo, cashshennee iitatithii ubba yinttipp hakithoytta. <verse eid="EPH 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32"/>Aathii wolis keehannee qadhinttizita maaqqoytta. Xooss Kiristtoosa baggar yinttis atto geezay garkk yinttikka wolis atto goytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:13">Qol. 3:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 4:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1"/>Yikkee, Xoossii dosiza na7itay garkk eza aazoytta. <verse eid="EPH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2"/>Kiristtoosa nuna dosii fana nu gishos Xoossis tonkki gi sawuza imonnee yarshsho udii inggeezay garkk yinttikka siiqor yezoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:18">Kes. 29:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 40:6">Maz. 40:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3"/>Zini laammo, tunatithinnee uuzetithii ammaniza asayis beezoowa gishos yi gancce ubbarakka si7inttippe. <verse eid="EPH 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4"/>Xooss galatoyttappe attin yeellathiza bazi boozotith nahshsa woy ari7ee yinttis beezowazay gishos yi gancce ubbarakka yezippe. <verse eid="EPH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5"/>Yhaya eroytta; oonkka laame woy tuna baz ootho woy uuzatto Eeqas goynnos tenttetto Kiristtoosa kaatetithinnee Xooss kaatetitha laattodayis danda7ooya.<verse eid="EPH 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6"/>Yhayititaypp denddeezayid Xooss kachchii azazinttowa asayil afa ye7od gishos oonkka yinttan pathoowa odar dooshshippe. <verse eid="EPH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7"/>Yey garkk asayir pettipettithii oothipate. <verse eid="EPH 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8"/>Binii yi dhuma, zin yhatti Goday baggayir poo7o. Yikkee, poo7o as garkk poo7or yedhdhoytta. <verse eid="EPH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9"/>Poo7o lo77otith, xillotithinnee tumatith aafiza.<verse eid="EPH 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10"/>Goda ufayssiza abaz oothodayis koyoytta. <verse eid="EPH 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11"/>Aafe baa dhuma ooso qonccisoyttapp attin ezar maqinttipate. <verse eid="EPH 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12"/>Unttii geema oothiza oosay hara attozin ododayisikka yeellathiza. <verse eid="EPH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13"/>Zini ubba baz poo7ol kezeez wode qonccer benttiza. <verse eid="EPH 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14"/>Poo7o ubba baz qonccer beeziza. Yeyi gishos,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">«Naati genttizayo barkkoba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">yhayiqopp denddoba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">Kiristtoosa nees poo7iza» yeegintteeza.<verse eid="EPH 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15"/>Yikkee, yi wayizii yezizako akaakii bo7oytta. Eccita maaqqoyttapp attin boozita maaqqipatte. <verse eid="EPH 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16"/>Gallasitay iita maaqqeez gishos layitha wozoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:5">Qol. 4:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17"/>Yeyi gishos, Goday shenay abizako akaakoyttapp attin boozipatte.<verse eid="EPH 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18"/>Geeshsha Ayyanar kumoyttapp attin dhaboko yinttan kaalithiz woyne ushshar mathipate. <verse eid="EPH 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19"/>Mazmuurer, sabarannee ayyana yethar, pettay pettayir odinttoytta. Ma yi wozinayir mazimuurttaranne sabbittar Goda galatooytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19-20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:16-17">Qol. 3:16-17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20"/>Nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa sunthayir ubba wode Xooss Ada ubbabazis galatooytta.<verse eid="EPH 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21"/>Kiristtoosa bonchchos gi pettay pettayis haarinttoytta.<verse eid="EPH 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Azin baggannee machchii bagga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22"/>Machchitayyo, Godayis haarinttizay garkk yi azinitayiskka haarinttoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:18">Qol. 3:18</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:1">1 Phix. 3:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23"/>Kiristtoosa woosa keethis kustte maaqqeezay garkk azinayikka fa machchis kustte. Ma Kiristtoosa fa asetithi maaqqeez woosa keethi ashshizaya. <verse eid="EPH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24"/>Zini woosa keethay Kiristtoosas haarinttizay garkk machchitay fa azinitayis ubba bazar haarinttodayis beeziza.<verse eid="EPH 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25"/>Azinitayyo, Kiristtoosa woosa keeth dosii I gishos fana inggeezay garkk yinttikka yi machchita dosoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:19">Qol. 3:19</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:7">1 Phix. 3:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26"/>E yeya ootheezay woosa keeth geeshshodayis koyii udeeza, geeshsheezaykka fa qaalay baggar haathar meeccii. <verse eid="EPH 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27"/>Kiristtoosa woosa keeth qita woy sino tukith woy yey garkkez baz bayth E kunth bonchchor geeshshinnee borinttoozanno udii faako shiishodayis koyii yeya udeeza. <verse eid="EPH 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28"/>Yey garkkekka, azinttay fana dosizay garkk fa machchita dosodayis beeziza. Fa machchat dosizay fana dosiza. <verse eid="EPH 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29"/>Fana ixxiza as oonkka baaya, zin Kiristtoosa woosa keethis oothizay garkk fa asetitha muzizannee naagiza. <verse eid="EPH 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30"/>Nuunii Kiristtoosa asetith billitita.<verse eid="EPH 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31"/>Xooss qaalay, «Yeyi gishos, asii fa adannee fa indato ashshii, fa machchatir wola yessada; unttii nam7itaykka pettii asho maaqqiza» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Medhe. 2:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32"/>Yhay gita xuura, zin taanii yeya Kiristtoosa baggannee woosa keethi bagga aaziso udii odiza. <verse eid="EPH 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33"/>Yey garkkekka, yi pettay pettay fa machchato, fana dosizay garkk doso. Machchakka fa azina bonchchodayis beeziza.<verse eid="EPH 5:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Na7itay baggannee yeleezitay bagga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1"/>Na7itayyo, Goday gisho gi yinttan yeleezitayis azazinttoytta. Yeyi yinttis beeziza bazii.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:20">Qol. 3:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2"/>«Ne adannee ne indato bonchchoba.» Yeyi ufayssa qaala yez tiina azazo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2-3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Kes. 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Nam7i. 5:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3"/>«Ne yeya polizabaz maaqqiko ubbay nees hanoda; ne laythaykka sa7all afa aduqqoda.»<verse eid="EPH 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4"/>Yeleezitayo, yi na7ita Goday qaalar tamaarssorannee unttan kaalithor dichchoyttapp attin unttan yilothipatte.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:21">Qol. 3:21</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Goditay baggannee ayllitay bagga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5"/>Ayllitayyo, Kiristtoosas azazinttizay garkk asho goditayis yashshara, bonchchorannee luule wozinar azazinttoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:22-25">Qol. 3:22-25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6"/>Kiristtoosa aylle garkk Xooss shene wozinapp poloyttapp attin galata denggodayis u tiina aadda oothipatte. <verse eid="EPH 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7"/>Asis baazin Godayis oothizay garkk yi kunth wozinaypp oothoytta. <verse eid="EPH 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8"/>Aylle maaqqin god maaqqin pettay pettay fa oothiz lo77o oothayis Godaypp woyito ekkodana eriza.<verse eid="EPH 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9"/>Goditayyo, as aafe zoqo bi7ii pirddoowa yinttisinnee unttis Goday, salo yezana yi eriza. Yeyi gishos, yi ayllita maniddiza ashshii unttii yinttis kiitinttizaygarkk yi unttis lo77o baz oothoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:1">Qol. 4:1</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 10:17">Nam7i. 10:17</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:25">Qol. 3:25</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xooss ola massara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10"/>Yikk yhayppe, Godayranne E damma wolqqayir miinggoytta. <verse eid="EPH 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11"/>Daabuloosa doosha gamodayis danda7od garkk Xoossii yinttis inggeez ola miishe ubba danccoytta. <verse eid="EPH 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12"/>Nu olay asar baazin salo yez tuna ayyanitayir olizitayira, mawute aditayir, haarizitayrannee yha dhuma alame wolqqitayra.<verse eid="EPH 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13"/>Yeyi gishos, iita gallasa morkke teqqodayisnnee ubba polii, miinggii eqqinttodayis yi danda7oday garkk Xooss ola miishita ubba danccoytta. <verse eid="EPH 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14"/>Tuma, xeessal zinnare garkk danccii, xillotith xurure garkk tiral gaddii, <verse eid="EPH 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15"/>sarotith Wonggile yi toke caamma garkk aathii miinggii eqqoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:5">Isa. 11:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 59:17">Isa. 59:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 52:7">52:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16"/>Ye ubbaypp aathii, Xalahe dakkiz laxiz tama dongge ubba to7isodayis danda7iza ammano ubba wode gonddalle garkk aykkoytta. <verse eid="EPH 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17"/>Xooss atotithana biraata barnneexa garkk yi ommayil gaddoytta; ma Geeshsha Ayyana mashsha, yeykka Xooss qaala aykkoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:17">Isa. 59:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18"/>Woosa ashshipate; yhankkitayiskka guuroytta; ubba wode Ayyanar woossoytta. Ezayid, geeshshitayis azalekkazar miinggii ubba wode woossoytta. <figure style="fig" alt="Roman soldier in armor" file="LB00196B.tif" size="span" ref="6:18">Orome wotadaray kunth ola miishe ma77eezaya</figure><verse eid="EPH 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19"/>Taanii Wonggile xuura yashsha bayith qonccisii ododay garkk Xoossii taas qaala inggod garkk woossoytta. <verse eid="EPH 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20"/>Taanii yeya oothodayis kiitizayinnee yhattekka achcha yezay ye Wonggilay gishos. Yeyi gishos, taanii yashsha bayth beezizay garkk ododay garkk taas woossoytta.<verse eid="EPH 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wurssith sarotho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21"/>Taanii wayizii yezakkonnee ab oothizako yi erod garkk nu siiqo ishay, Goday oosor ammanintteez oosanchchay, Tikiqoosa, ta baz ubba yinttis ododa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Haw. O. 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:12">2 Xim. 4:12</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:7-8">Qol. 4:7-8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22"/>Nuunii ubbay wayizii yezako yinttis ododay garkkennee yi wozina minthathod garkk taanii eza yinttiko kiiteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:10">Medhe. 21:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23"/>Xooss Adaypp, Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosapp sarotithinnee siiqo ammanor wola nu ishitay ubbitayis maaqqo. <verse eid="EPH 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24"/>Irxxoowa siiqor nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa dosiza ubbayira Xooss aadho keehatithay maaqqo.<verse eid="EPH 6:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6"/>
</usx>
